## 10. Interview Questions

**Q1. What is a 2D array?**

An array containing rows and columns.

**Q2. What does `accounts[i][j]` represent?**

The balance of customer `i` in bank account `j`.

**Q3. Why do we use nested loops?**

To visit every customer and every bank account.

**Q4. Why is `sum = 0` inside the outer loop?**

Because every customer needs a separate wealth calculation.

**Q5. Why do we return `largestSum`?**

It stores the maximum wealth found among all customers.

**Q6. What is the time complexity?**

O(m × n).

